Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tinymist
Architecture: any
Depends: ca-certificates, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: language server for the Typst typesetting system
 Tinymist is a language server (LSP/DAP) for Typst. It provides code
 completion, jump to definition, diagnostics, linting, live document preview,
 and export to PDF/SVG/PNG/Markdown for Typst documents in any LSP-capable
 editor.
 .
 The CLI also offers a typst-compatible compile subcommand and a preview
 server. Tinymist embeds its own (forked) Typst compiler, so installing the
 typst package is not required.
